  | --------- | --------- |
  | 1         | "a"       |
  | 2         | "b"       |
  | 3         | "c"       |
  | 4         | "d"       |

  ```
  # No label column specified
  dataset = tf.data.experimental.make_csv_dataset(filename, batch_size=2)
  iterator = dataset.as_numpy_iterator()
  print(dict(next(iterator)))
